From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 03:13:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll/server iOS: loader and ARM64EC signal fixes, file and
 sync paths, inproc-sync and thread bookkeeping

Loader and ARM64EC exception path changes for the native D3D12 runtime
bring-up, file-path fixes on the sandboxed file system, sync fast path
support, and wineserver-side inproc sync and thread bookkeeping.

Madeira-commit: d88d55eee004943170cd92bda8dc9cc961121536
Rebased: clean
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
